# A document with no metadata block at all

The dialect must not require one: this file opens with a heading, carries no
attributes on it, and still has to read exactly as `pandoc -f markdown` does.

- A bullet
- Another, with `code` and *emphasis*

> A quote with a [link](https://example.com "and a title").

```rust
fn main() {}
```

Inline math $x^2 + y^2$ and a task list:

- [x] done
- [ ] not done

Ordinary text with a ~~strikeout~~ and an ampersand & a less-than <.
